From 96d10007387e53c8c3d488d4f1bcab120ed6c825 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opensource<quic_username@quicinc.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Oct 2024 07:17:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Mplane-required changes.

Allow all versions when reading server capabilities. O-RAN modules
use YANG version 1.1 instead of 1.0, they would be left out with the old
LYS_VERSION_1.

Allow the mplane generated message ids in addition to internally
generated message id.

fix send complete rpc reply msg to NetConf client and MplaneApp

re-call-home-no-ssh-time feature support

Forward error message without adding any xml tags

Adding default value of re_call_home_no_ssh_timer

Invaldate mplane message ID after use

libnetconf2 support for local binding

Return only yang version 1.0 modules in <hello> message.

Fix memory leak that happens when client is terminated

Implment support for max call home attempts

Add callback notification when max call home attemps
have been made

support for mplane dscp change

Callback notification when max call home attemps have been made is done
only if no clients is connected
